                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nam-summary",
                  "content": "The next chapter of Midnight Satin brings new voices, deeper worlds, and more ways for readers to shape the stories they love.",
                  "fill": "$color.textMuted",
                  "fontFamily": "Literata",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "fontStyle": "italic",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "width": 342,
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "nam-ornament",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "horizontal",
                  "justifyContent": "center",
                  "alignItems": "center",
                  "gap": 12,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "rectangle",
                      "id": "nam-ornament-rule-l",
                      "width": 32,
                      "height": 1,
                      "fill": "$color.primary"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "rectangle",
                      "id": "nam-ornament-diamond",
                      "width": 8,
                      "height": 8,
                      "fill": "$color.void",
                      "stroke": {
                        "align": "inside",
                        "thickness": 1,
                        "fill": "$color.primary"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "rectangle",
                      "id": "nam-ornament-rule-r",
                      "width": 32,
                      "height": 1,
                      "fill": "$color.primary"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nam-heading",
                  "content": "The room beyond the page",
                  "fill": "$color.primary",
                  "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
                  "fontSize": 23,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "fontStyle": "italic",
                  "width": 342,
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nam-paragraph-0",
                  "content": "When we opened the doors to Midnight Satin, we imagined a quiet room after dark: velvet chairs, candlelight, and a shelf of stories chosen for the readers who still believe anticipation is an art.",
                  "fill": "#EAEAEAE6",
                  "fontFamily": "Literata",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "lineHeight": 1.65,
                  "width": 342,
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nam-paragraph-1",
                  "content": "That room is growing. Over the coming weeks, new authors will join the library with romances that move from rain-soaked London to gilded coastal estates. Each story remains built around the details that matter most—charged glances, impossible choices, and characters worth losing sleep over.",
                  "fill": "#EAEAEAE6",
                  "fontFamily": "Literata",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "lineHeight": 1.65,
                  "width": 342,
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nam-paragraph-2",
                  "content": "We are also preparing more ways to take part beyond the page. Reader endorsements will shape weekly spotlights, limited campaigns will unlock special rewards, and The Gazette will continue to share the people and craft behind every release.",
                  "fill": "#EAEAEAE6",
                  "fontFamily": "Literata",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "lineHeight": 1.65,
                  "width": 342,
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "nam-quote",
                  "width": 342,
                  "layout": "horizontal",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "padding": [
                    4,
                    0,
                    4,
                    16
                  ],
                  "stroke": {
                    "align": "inside",
                    "thickness": {
                      "left": 2
                    },
                    "fill": "#D4AF3766"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "nam-quote-text",
                      "content": "Romance has always lived in the space between what is said and what is almost confessed.",
                      "fill": "$color.textMuted",
                      "fontFamily": "Literata",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "lineHeight": 1.55,
                      "width": 322,
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width"
                    }
                  ]
                },
